' Notes for the boundary and control classes (class-model.iuml).
package control {
  note top of GameUI
    <b>Dependency inversion</b>
    GameController depends on the GameUI interface,
    which is declared in the control package. GameCLI
    implements it for the console, and the test double
    ScriptedUI implements it in the tests, so whole games
    run in JUnit and no game rule lives in the console code.
  end note

  note right of GameSetup
    Builds the base game: the Menu (3 Dishes, 3 ComboMeals),
    a Restaurant with a new TurnLog and HappyHour, the four
    staff, GameConfig.base() and ArrivalSchedule.base(),
    then the GameController. GameController owns its
    Scoreboard (composition), as GameCLI owns its StatusView.
  end note
}
